# Run outputs are ignored by default: a campaign writes hundreds of MB of
# per-flight traces (events.jsonl, samples.json), camera frames and logs that
# regenerate from the run.
#
# Exception: the pilot-8 campaign summaries under artifacts/pilot8 are tracked
# on purpose, added with `git add -f`. They are the evidence behind the clean
# baseline and the three-method comparison, they are ~5 MB of JSON, and they do
# not regenerate once the OSMO workspace is torn down. Add future evidence the
# same way, and add only summaries: never events.jsonl, samples.json, *.jpg or
# *.log.
artifacts/
